# Code owners for this repository.
#
# Branch protection on `main` requires a review from a code owner before a
# pull request can merge. Repository admins bypass that requirement, so the
# maintainer can merge their own work without waiting for a second pair of
# eyes, while everyone else needs a maintainer's review.
#
# See: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

